id: pm-ulqu
title: "GH-519: close recovery bundle suggests --validate-close \"<value>\" for an enum flag and hides the real resolution-fields blocker"
description: Make close failure recovery show enum values accurately and surface missing resolution fields before secondary validation guidance.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: agent-ux,"area:cli",gh-issue
created_at: "2026-07-11T22:55:46.032Z"
