completed_at: "2026-08-09T22:09:14.140Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "suggested_retry renders enum-valued flags with allowed values inline (--validate-close <off|warn|strict>) instead of a generic <value> placeholder; when strict close validation blocks a close, the FIRST error surfaces missing resolution/expected_result/actual_result with a suggested pm update retry carrying those flags; regression specs cover both the enum rendering and the blocker-first ordering; agent reaches the actionable error in 1 invocation instead of 3"
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: Ordered close recovery by executable validation phase and sourced placeholders from enum contracts.
expected_result: The first recovery step is actionable and enum values are valid choices.
actual_result: Focused regression tests and manual strict-close acceptance confirm executable ordering and domains.
